WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:09.660
One year ago an attempted coup in Turkey
failed. It's still not clear exactly what

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:13.710
happened. Who was behind it?
President Erdogan blames Fethullah

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:18.779
Gulen: a US-based Islamic cleric and an
ally turned critic. But the evidence

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:22.420
Erdogan has offered in support of his
extradition has been short on proof.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:27.900
There's other suspects: officers upset by
Erdogan's anti-secularist leanings had motive.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.880
Erdogan himself once quipped: "my goal
is to raise an islamic generation," or it

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:36.780
could have been a Reichstag fire type
plot to justify a crackdown.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:40.469
Erdogan called the attempt a "gift from God."
My own theory is: all of the above.

00:00:40.469 --> 00:00:44.309
Erdogan may have discovered the plot
early, but allowed it to continue to

00:00:44.309 --> 00:00:49.410
justify the crackdown.  What's certain is
is this: Turkey today is a dictatorship. It's

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:53.309
anti US,
anti Europe, and pro Russia. It's the

00:00:53.309 --> 00:00:58.170
most anti NATO NATO member. What we're
witnessing now however is a sprint to

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:03.899
erase Ataturk's legacy and replace
Turkey with an Islamic state by 2023 the

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:08.340
hundredth anniversary of turkey's
independence we've been covering turkey

00:01:08.340 --> 00:01:14.549
a lot of AEI check out our work at WWII
org or let us know your thoughts in the

00:01:14.549 --> 00:01:18.330
comments also let us know what other
topics you'd like our scholars cover in

00:01:18.330 --> 00:01:24.380
60 seconds and be sure to subscribe for
